+scoreboards through real PlaceholderAPI `%gangland_*%` tokens that Gangland's own placeholder expansion still
+publishes. Plaque owns its own `settings.yml`/`scoreboard.yml` and `/plaque reload` command; any
+scoreboard-specific feature or test documentation now lives in that repo.
 
